{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me reconsider the clues more carefully. The combination of \"married 3-4 times,\" \"only one child survives,\" and \"plays alongside real-life relative though unrelated in series\" is very specific. Let me think about \"The 100\" - Richard Harmon plays Murphy. But let me reconsider shows like \"Shameless,\" \"The Vampire Diaries,\" \"Pretty Little Liars,\" etc.\n\nActually, let me reconsider the \"only one child survives\" clue - this strongly suggests a character who had multiple children but most died. This is a hallmark of certain dramas. Let me think about \"This Is Us\" - but that started 2016. Let me search for the specific combination with the real-life relative angle being key.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"actor real life sibling spouse plays unrelated character same TV show\", \"TV show cast real life couple relatives play unrelated characters\", \"series where real life family members play unrelated roles\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_eb3f228d72cd4304abc30618","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"character married four times three marriages TV series children died\", \"TV drama character multiple marriages only one child alive\", \"long running series character widowed multiple times children\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_69d82ac3d4b24f35aa299768","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789467789,"id":"chatcmpl-8ee35968-96ef-9966-99e7-87f7e246ba54","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":19923,"completion_tokens":249,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":20172,"cached_tokens":3328,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3328},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}